---
import BaseLayout from '~/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import FlashApptNav from '~/components/ui/FlashApptNav.astro';
const title='FlashAppt for consumers — Watch, save, refer and book again';
const description='Find nearby appointment openings, save favourite businesses, create detailed watches, and book again after completed visits.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical="/products/flash-appt/consumer" ogImage="/screenshots/flash-appt/publishable/consumer/consumer-marketplace-desktop.webp">
  <FlashApptNav />
  <section class="sub-hero"><div class="container"><span>FlashAppt for consumers</span><h1>Find the opening. Remember the business.</h1><p>Discover nearby last-minute appointments, follow the businesses you like, and make it easier to return after a great visit.</p><a href="mailto:hello@flashappt.com?subject=FlashAppt%20consumer%20pilot">Join the consumer pilot</a></div></section>
  <section class="content"><div class="container"><header><span>Discover and return</span><h2>Built for more than a one-time booking.</h2></header><div class="grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Save favourites</h3><p>Save favourite businesses and receive priority alerts when they publish an opening.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Create appointment watches</h3><p>Watch by service, category, maximum price, preferred day, and preferred time.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Book securely</h3><p>Reserve an available opening and use your signed FlashAppt pass to check in when you arrive.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Book again directly</h3><p>After a completed, checked-in FlashAppt visit, book again directly with that merchant and keep the relationship going.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="notice"><div class="container notice-grid"><div><span>Good to know</span><h2>Alerts improve discovery. They do not hold an opening.</h2></div><div><p>Priority alerts and appointment watches do not reserve or guarantee an appointment. Openings remain subject to availability until booking is completed.</p><p>After a completed, checked-in FlashAppt visit, direct rebooking lets you continue with the merchant without keeping that relationship inside the marketplace.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="cta"><div class="container"><h2>Be ready when the right opening appears.</h2><a href="/products/flash-appt/faq">Read the FAQ</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  :global(body){background:#09090b}.sub-hero{padding:110px 0 90px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 20%,rgba(109,40,217,.28),transparent 35%),#09090b;color:#fff}.sub-hero>div{max-width:900px}.sub-hero span,.content header span,.notice span{color:#a78bfa;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.sub-hero h1,.content h2,.notice h2,.cta h2{font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.045em}.sub-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:.98;margin:16px 0}.sub-hero p{color:#aaaab4;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:700px}.sub-hero a,.cta a{display:inline-block;margin-top:25px;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6d28d9,#4f46e5);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}.content,.notice{padding:90px 0;color:#fff}.content{background:#101012}.content header{max-width:760px}.content h2,.notice h2,.cta h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.7rem);line-height:1.05;margin:12px 0 28px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}.grid article{padding:25px;border:1px solid #2b2b31;border-radius:20px;background:#18181b}.grid b{color:#a78bfa}.grid h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin:12px 0 7px}.grid p,.notice p{color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.7}.notice{background:#09090b}.notice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px}.notice p+p{margin-top:18px}.cta{text-align:center;padding:80px 0;background:#130d22;color:#fff}@media(max-width:700px){.grid,.notice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sub-hero{padding:85px 0 70px}.content,.notice{padding:65px 0}}
</style>
